 <h3><u>Sajda ek aisa</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Sajda ek aisa karbobala me adaa hua..(2)<br> jiske sabab hai khana e kaaba bacha hua</p> 
  <p>1. Is baat ke gawaah shah e mursaleen hai<br> jis khaak ke khameer se yusuf haseen hai<br> us me husain ka hai paseena mila hua</p> 
  <p>2. Heere pade the kaanch ke tukdo ke saath saath<br> zehra ne chun liye hai ye kehkar jawaherat<br> in aasuo pe naam hai mera likha hua</p> 
  <p>3. Jaisa diya hai wesa hi fanoos chahiye<br> jannat ke shahzade ko malboos chahiye<br> rizwaan laao arsh se kurta sila hua</p> 
  <p>4. Darwaza e ali ke namak khaar aagae<br> jannat me shahe deen ke azadar aagae<br> sach hogaya husain ki maa ka kaha hua</p> 
  <p>5. Pushte nabi pe aaj imamat ka naaz hai<br> waed mujhe bata ke ye kaisi namaaz hai<br> kis waaste nabi ka hai sajda ruka hua</p> 
  <p>6. Wo bhi hai ek sipahi husaini sipah ka<br> karta hu ehteram me yu zuljanah ka<br> khaak e shifa me uska bhi khoo hai mila hua</p> 
  <p>7. Chaaya hua dimaagh pe uske ghubaar hai<br> usko bhi ab husain ka ghum na gawaar hai<br> tukdo pe jo husain ke palkar bada hua</p> 
  <p>8. Is meer e khush nawa ke tarannum pa naaz hai<br> sacchaiyo ko iske takallum pe naaz hai<br> kyu ke hai ye husain ke darr ka padha hua</p> 
